T187 - precomputed rain support field, feasibility campaign
Branch experiment/cloud-descriptor-k, parent 443e742 (T186). Not merged.
Ultra, raw scale 0.2500, cloud target 480x270, framebuffer 1920x1080,
96 steps, 60 samples per cell, three anchor-bracketed blocks per arm per pose.

The first launch hard-crashed the client during shader-variant loading
(exit -805306369) after ~6 minutes of compilation with 127 declared variants;
runClient-t187.out.log is that partial run. A clean relaunch
(runClient-t187b.out.log) completed all 38 cells and is the run reported here.

